  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Italia</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Lucania et Bruttii was a province of the Roman Empire according to the Verona List (ca. A.D. 303\u2013324). While its boundaries are difficult to establish, this administrative division succeeds the third Augustan region (regio III) of Italy that shares the same name.",
